# agentic-harness runtime (machine-specific; never commit)
.harness/state.json
.harness/state.json.*.tmp
.harness/telemetry.log
.harness/daemon.pid
.harness/inbox/*
.harness/completed/*
.harness/failed/*
.harness/worktrees/*
.harness/memory/sessions/*
!.harness/**/.gitkeep
# Memory (profile.md, lessons.md, auto-lessons.md) IS committed so it travels with the project.
# Add those three files here too if your memory is private and the repo is public.
